window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She might just look like an ordinary—if beautiful—young woman, but Iriya is anything but ordinary!</p> <p>A ruthless warrior clad in red armor, Iriya is a Hunter determined to exterminate the vampires that were once her parents and siblings.</p> <p>Now, half-vampire, half-human D has to decide to offer his assistance, get out of the way, or have a dangerous battle on his hands!</p> <p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p> <p>Performed by Scott McCormick, Rita Amparita, Terence Aselford, David Cui Cui, Mecca Rogers, KenYatta Rogers, Zura Johnson, Danny Gavigan, Steve Wannall, Thomas Penny, Joe Mallon, Matthew Bassett, Drew Kopas, Torian Brackett, Rose Elizabeth Supan, Karenna Foley, Ryan Haugen, Lena Lee, Wyn Delano, LaMont Ridgell, Sarah Ruth Thomas, James Konicek, Andrew Quilpa, Lise Bruneau, Peter Holdway and Mort Shelby.</p>"; 
